    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 45,
     "y": 128.2,
     "text": "The party",
     "font": "display",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 140.36,
     "tracking": -0.5
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 200.1,
     "text": "Ivy is nine. She wanted a small party, “just family”, and then",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 299.3
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 215.1,
     "text": "sent us a list of who counted as family, which included her swim",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 316.87
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 230.1,
     "text": "coach and the lady from the bakery. We negotiated.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 254.11
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 252.6,
     "text": "In the end it was the grandparents, Kate and Marcus and Finn,",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 308.55
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 267.6,
     "text": "and a cake shaped like a swimming pool that I made at eleven",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 302.83
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 282.6,
     "text": "o’clock the night before. The water was blue frosting. The",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 285.66
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 297.6,
     "text": "swimmers were gummy bears. Tom ate the lifeguard.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 264.68
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 330.54,
     "text": "Nine candles",
     "font": "heading",
     "size": 14,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 89.78
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 345.6,
     "text": "Grandpa Joe wore a paper crown for the entire afternoon and",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 304.4
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 360.6,
     "text": "refused to take it off for the photos, or for the drive home. She",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 306.68
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 375.6,
     "text": "blew out all nine candles in one go and then announced she",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 292.85
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "x": 133,
     "y": 390.6,
     "text": "would not be telling anyone the wish, “not even Biscuit”.",
     "font": "story",
     "size": 10.5,
     "color": "#101B3B",
     "w": 280.83
    }
   ],
